                        "form": "multiculturalisms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "adbfd1de-abfc-3326-9342-dfb1c17357dc",
                        "entry_id": "253fd8ae-bea0-30ac-82b8-3b3958dda2a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Multiculturalisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "092afc0e-c233-4ec2-8bdd-de54dab2c9f8",
                                "sense_id": "adbfd1de-abfc-3326-9342-dfb1c17357dc",
                                "text": "Something had to replace the threat of communism, and at last a workable substitute is at hand. \"Multiculturalism,\" as the new menace is known, has been denounced in the media recently as the new McCarthyism, the new fundamentalism, even the new totalitarianism -- take your choice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e2c9387-a838-419a-bf8d-272e4d902ce7",
                                "sense_id": "adbfd1de-abfc-3326-9342-dfb1c17357dc",
                                "text": "Britain has pursued a policy of multiculturalism - allowing people of different cultures to settle without expecting them to integrate into society."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5702946a-f3ff-41a6-ab82-25ab4aef7c98",
                                "sense_id": "adbfd1de-abfc-3326-9342-dfb1c17357dc",
                                "text": "Earlier this year he said multiculturalism had “failed”, that immigrants needed to “melt” into French society, and that “we do not want ostentatious prayers in the street in France.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
